{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"agent_message","text":"The artifact verification exposed a mapping defect before tests: classic `ctags` misses functions declared through libpng macros, so some later errors were assigned to the preceding visible function. I’m correcting the generator to use Clang’s parsed `FunctionDecl` source ranges, which handles macro-generated definitions and gives reliable function ownership. The symbol counts themselves are unaffected."}}
